[TITLE]
richards gate: reaction species in (non-Richards) LID storage nodes: captured inflow with an external species mass source and evaporation (msxlid::prepareNodes' capture and evaporation transfers), a pollutant beside the species, an outlet port in the held surface cell (S1, msxlid outlet) and a held incoming port (S2, msxlid receive)
[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS CFS
FLOW_ROUTING DYNWAVE
QUALITY_SOLVER LEGACY
START_DATE 01/01/2026
END_DATE 01/01/2026
END_TIME 00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP .7
MINIMUM_STEP .001
VARIABLE_STEP 0
REPORT_STEP 00:00:15
WET_STEP 00:00:10
DRY_STEP 00:00:10
IGNORE_GROUNDWATER YES
IGNORE_2D YES
[EVAPORATION]
CONSTANT 3.0
[JUNCTIONS]
J 1 3 0 0 0
[STORAGE]
S1 0 2 1 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 100 0 1
S2 0 2 .3 FUNCTIONAL 0 0 100 0 1
[OUTFALLS]
O 0 FREE
O2 0 FREE
O3 0 FREE
[CONDUITS]
C S1 O 100 .013 0 0
F S1 O2 50 .013 1.6 0
G J S2 50 .013 0 1.2
H S2 O3 100 .013 0 0
[XSECTIONS]
C CIRCULAR .2 0 0 0 1
F CIRCULAR .3 0 0 0 1
G CIRCULAR .3 0 0 0 1
H CIRCULAR .05 0 0 0 1
[DWF]
S1 FLOW .6
S1 TSS 20
J FLOW .04
J TSS 5
[POLLUTANTS]
TSS MG/L 0 0 0 0 NO * 0 10
[REACTION_OPTIONS]
COUPLING FULL
RATE_UNITS SEC
PATTERN_TIMESTEP 17
[REACTION_SPECIES]
BULK A MG
BULK B MG
[REACTION_COEFFICIENTS]
PARAMETER k 0.030000
[REACTION_PIPES]
RATE A -k*A
RATE B k*A
[REACTION_TANKS]
RATE A -k*A
RATE B k*A
[REACTION_QUALITY]
GLOBAL A 1
[REACTION_PATTERNS]
p 1 0 2
[REACTION_SOURCES]
MASS S1 A .2 p
MASS J B .1
[REPORT]
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
[LID_CONTROLS]
Stack NODE
Stack SURFACE 6 .1
Stack MEDIA 12 .45 .2 .08 2 10 3
Stack AGGREGATE 6 .4 100
Stack BOTTOM .5 0
[LID_NODES]
S1 Stack 10
S2 Stack 10
[REACTION_LIDS]
CONTROL Stack TRANSPORT
CONTROL Stack LAYER 0 RATE A -k*A
CONTROL Stack LAYER 0 RATE B k*A
